<h1 class="nm-h1" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:34px;font-weight:600;color:#1B2B4B;">
  Your plan renews soon
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
  {{firstName}}, your <strong>{{planName}}</strong> plan renews on <strong>{{renewalDate}}</strong>.
  We'll charge {{amount}} to your saved payment method — no action needed if you're happy to continue.
</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" class="nm-cta" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
  <tr><td align="center" bgcolor="#1B2B4B" style="border-radius:8px;">
    <a href="{{appUrl}}/settings/subscription" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 32px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Manage subscription</a>
  </td></tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#9CA3AF;">
  You can cancel any time before {{renewalDate}} and keep access until then.
</p>
